{"name": "jumpo world", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"65\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371220/extras/8f162a742624a4dee56f37caee8a1f86.avif?t=1761006753\" width=\"615\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">warning: this game is hard. anything can and will kill you in this reaction-based platformer with randomly generated biomes\u00a0&amp; great variations of enemies and obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371220/extras/8b87c49db9a46c584b66ce9300735c78.poster.avif?t=1761006753\" width=\"720\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371220/extras/8b87c49db9a46c584b66ce9300735c78.webm?t=1761006753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"65\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371220/extras/22cbd809cd5377d6cd0e4614d57df7f0.avif?t=1761006753\" width=\"615\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"184\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371220/extras/dcdcb47e8c30484858659acf3c5dfad8.avif?t=1761006753\" width=\"614\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">only 10 players make it to the global leaderboard \u2014 a mark of ultimate skill and achievement. will you claim your spot at the top?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"65\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371220/extras/ca2e6f2987b4bac1729ff4b42cc2da55.avif?t=1761006753\" width=\"615\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">in jumpo world the biomes ahead are randomly sequenced, meaning you never know which challenged you will be faced with next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371220/extras/bcdbad885e113da9cdf3b05c6ae53c35.poster.avif?t=1761006753\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371220/extras/bcdbad885e113da9cdf3b05c6ae53c35.webm?t=1761006753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"65\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371220/extras/30b717d519eb8fc72c3b099e3909d25c.avif?t=1761006753\" width=\"615\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">discover the land by foot, on a horse, on a minecart, maybe even as a frog? No biome is like another, and there is never a guarantee on what you will travel with or what you will travel as.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371220/extras/a4dc33a140a08beb3f5e58beccfdb6fa.poster.avif?t=1761006753\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371220/extras/a4dc33a140a08beb3f5e58beccfdb6fa.webm?t=1761006753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "run, jump & hide! get as far as possible in the bizarre world of jumpo world. you only have one life, make it count.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371220/header.jpg?t=1761006753", 